    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement by a Bard)</em></p><p>An <em>Instrument of the Bards</em> is better than an ordinary instrument in every way. Seven kinds of these instruments exist, each named after a bard college. The table below lists the spells common to all these instruments and the spells specific to this one. A creature that tries to play the instrument without being attuned to it must succeed on a DC 15 Wisdom saving throw or take 2d4 Psychic damage.</p><p>You can play the instrument to cast one of its spells. Once the instrument has been used to cast a spell, it can’t be used to cast that spell again until the next dawn. The spells use your spellcasting ability and spell save DC.</p><p><strong>Instruments of the Bards</strong></p><table><thead><tr><th>Instrument</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>All</td><td>—</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFly0000000]{Fly}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplInvisibili]{Invisibility}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLevitate00]{Levitate}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbEvilAndGoodPr]{Protection from Evil and Good}, plus the spells of the particular instrument</td></tr><tr><td>Canaith Mandolin</td><td>Rare</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplCureWounds]{Cure Wounds} (level 3), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbProtectionFro]{Protection from Energy} (Lightning damage only)</td></tr></tbody></table><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-e0i9WFAixq3LMbC3\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Chaque sort a sa propre utilisation, rendue à l’aube. <em>Protection from Energy</em> ne protège que du type indiqué.</p></section>",
